WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.820
Call your surgeon or clinic if all three

2
00:00:03.873 --> 00:00:04.780
of these are true:

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.300
the incision is red and swollen, it is

4
00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.100
not getting better over one to two days,

5
00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:12.540
and it hurts when touched.

6
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:14.820
Also call for any of these:

7
00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:19.300
a fever above 101.5 degrees Fahrenheit;

8
00:00:19.424 --> 00:00:22.660
swelling, or fluid building up, behind your ear;

9
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:27.700
a headache, light sensitivity, or excessive lethargy;

10
00:00:27.753 --> 00:00:30.100
or any question or concern about you or

11
00:00:30.132 --> 00:00:30.820
your child.
